error[E0521]: a 'const' field cannot have a setter
 --> $DIR/constant-setter.nra:5:11
  |
3 |     export const name = "default";
  |                  ---- 'name' is declared with 'const'
4 |         | get: name;
5 |         | set: name = value;
  |           ^^^ setter of a field that cannot be reassigned
  |
  = help: declare the field with 'let', or remove the setter

